    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image65-359bcea6-7ecd-4a0f-bc6d-4999b997de48.png\"/><br/><math><mo>∴</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image66-5ae4de7b-b22a-4750-9d45-455f35f5229a.png\"/><br/><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mat